{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2023-06-16 08:00:00', 'title': 'WABTEC ACQUIRES L&M RADIATOR, INC.', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & HIBBING, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ACQUIRED L&M RADIATOR, INC., A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF HEAVY-DUTY EQUIPMENT RADIATORS AND HEAT EXCHANGERS. “WE ARE EXCITED TO WELCOME L&M RADIATOR TO WABTEC,” SAID MIKE FETSKO, PRESIDENT OF WABTEC'S FREIGHT & INDUSTRIAL COMPONENTS BUSINESS. “THIS TRANSACTION WILL FURTHER WABTEC'S PRESENCE IN PREMIUM HEAT TRANSFER SOLUTIONS AND WILL EXTEND AND COMPLEMENT WABTEC'S MINING PRODUCTS PORTFO."}